        {
          "name": "welcome",
          "readonly": true,
          "topic": "Start here.",
          "post": "**Welcome to INSURGENCY PROTOCOL: THE FIFTH COLUMN** ⚔\n\nTwo ways to play. One server.\n\n**☠ THE INSURGENCY** — Persistent, chaotic, always on. US holds the FOB with top-tier gear. Soviets spawn hidden among civilians — unarmed means invisible, armed means fair game. Dynamic missions run 24/7 for both factions: HVT captures, cache sabotage, convoy demolition. Complete one, another spawns.\n\n**🎖 THE OPERATIONS** — Scheduled, structured, GM-run milsim. Bespoke coordinated ops with briefings, modern gear, and a live Game Master adapting the battlefield in real time. Earn rank through ops — rank unlocks gear access.\n\n**Get started:**\n→ Read the rules\n→ Grab a faction role (ask Command for now)\n→ Squad up in #lfg-squad-up\n→ Playtest feedback goes in #suggestions — early players shape this project\n\nServer name in Reforger browser: **Insurgency Protocol**\nInvite your friends: https://discord.gg/Qr4JZJmaVq"
        },
        {
          "name": "rules",
          "readonly": true,
          "topic": "Rules of engagement. Violations answer to Command.",
          "post": "**1. No cheating, exploiting, or ghosting.** Instant ban. Includes stream-sniping and cross-team intel leaking.\n**2. Respect the undercover system.** In-game deception is the point. Out-of-game harassment is not.\n**3. No toxicity.** Banter yes, abuse no. Racism/bigotry = instant ban.\n**4. Ops have standards.** Sign up = show up. Follow the GM and chain of command during scheduled operations.\n**5. Report, don't retaliate.** Issues go to #reports or DM Command.\n**6. Discord ToS applies.** You must be 13+."
        },
        {
